+ * (ds4_gpu_mellum_moe_reduce_add_tensor), the words of the call above followed by ds4_gpu_add_tensor(out, res,
+ * its out).  res is [n_tokens][n_embd] and checked with the rest. */
+int ds4_gpu_mellum_moe_add_tensor(
